  "header": {
    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-2493 open-field suite OF2 - on basic-desert's open field (scattered walls, cars, sandbags, tree clumps, a south ditch), 'Blue Platoon' (3 squads of 5) at x ~80 attacks (PlatoonAttack, AttackPosition round (266,512)) a 6-man 'Red Squad' defending the line at x 260-275 (foxholes + sandbags, SquadDefend) ~185 m east. Judge: the platoon attack (ATP 3-21.8): a squad SUPPORTS by fire from cover while another MANOEUVRES (bounds / fire and movement, the south ditch is the covered flank), the assault goes through, the line is taken (Red beaten, a Blue man on it) within 420 s. Fail: every Blue man still a minute while Red still fights (the ditch war), no squad supporting or none manoeuvring, or the line not taken. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh of-platoon-attack"
  },
